  <body>
    <div style="basic">
        <p begin="00:00:01.240" end="00:00:07.360" tts:direction="ltr">Hi, all. I hope you had a productive week
<br />off from Excel last week.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:07.360" end="00:00:11.040" tts:direction="ltr">I'm really excited to get jumping back in
<br />with you all.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:11.040" end="00:00:15.480" tts:direction="ltr">We are going to go 0-100 this week.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:15.480" end="00:00:19.400" tts:direction="ltr">It's going to build on a lot of concepts
<br />that we've already talked about.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:19.400" end="00:00:25.240" tts:direction="ltr">However, we're going to be applying it to
<br />a little bit more complex topics,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:25.240" end="00:00:28.000" tts:direction="ltr">which is great to showcase your skills.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:28.000" end="00:00:30.680" tts:direction="ltr">Based on feedback that I got from Week
<br />four,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:30.680" end="00:00:32.880" tts:direction="ltr">I'm going to approach this week a little
<br />different</p>
        <p begin="00:00:32.880" end="00:00:35.550" tts:direction="ltr">as regards to the learning resource.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:35.550" end="00:00:38.660" tts:direction="ltr">So given the complex nature of this topic,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:38.660" end="00:00:40.980" tts:direction="ltr">we're going to be talking a little bit
<br />about modeling.</p>
        <p begin="00:00:40.980" end="00:00:45.380" tts:direction="ltr">And essentially modeling is just this idea
<br />that we have a bunch of inputs,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:45.380" end="00:00:48.980" tts:direction="ltr">and based off of these relationships these
<br />inputs have,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:48.980" end="00:00:52.980" tts:direction="ltr">we can potentially predict or</p>
        <p begin="00:00:52.980" end="00:00:59.030" tts:direction="ltr">understand an output So we use this a lot
<br />in data analytics,</p>
        <p begin="00:00:59.030" end="00:01:03.310" tts:direction="ltr">and we're going to take a simplified
<br />approach to it this week.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:03.310" end="00:01:08.030" tts:direction="ltr">So the way the learning resources is going
<br />to be structured is,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:08.030" end="00:01:11.870" tts:direction="ltr">first off, you're going to watch this
<br />video like you're already doing.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:11.870" end="00:01:14.470" tts:direction="ltr">Then I'm going to do a quick intro to</p>
        <p begin="00:01:14.470" end="00:01:17.550" tts:direction="ltr">modeling and what a lot of these terms
<br />that we're going to be</p>
        <p begin="00:01:17.550" end="00:01:20.390" tts:direction="ltr">using really mean contextually because</p>
        <p begin="00:01:20.390" end="00:01:24.510" tts:direction="ltr">the textbook doesn't do a super great job
<br />placing it in context.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:24.510" end="00:01:26.350" tts:direction="ltr">It does a really great job at, again,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:26.350" end="00:01:28.070" tts:direction="ltr">walking you through the problems and</p>
        <p begin="00:01:28.070" end="00:01:31.910" tts:direction="ltr">the specific tools to answer some of these
<br />big business questions,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:31.910" end="00:01:37.640" tts:direction="ltr">but kind of lacks that context that I'm
<br />excited to walk you through.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:37.640" end="00:01:40.320" tts:direction="ltr">So after this video, watch that video.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:40.320" end="00:01:44.000" tts:direction="ltr">The read the textbook and watch some of
<br />those videos,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:44.000" end="00:01:46.280" tts:direction="ltr">specifically their intro videos.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:46.280" end="00:01:50.360" tts:direction="ltr">That's going to give you some more
<br />understanding about how the Excel tools</p>
        <p begin="00:01:50.360" end="00:01:54.905" tts:direction="ltr">work prior to going into the practice
<br />problems.</p>
        <p begin="00:01:54.905" end="00:01:59.210" tts:direction="ltr">Specifically for 5.2 practice problems,</p>
        <p begin="00:01:59.210" end="00:02:01.170" tts:direction="ltr">I'm going to do a short,</p>
        <p begin="00:02:01.170" end="00:02:03.930" tts:direction="ltr">I think it ended up being about 13 minute
<br />long video</p>
        <p begin="00:02:03.930" end="00:02:06.730" tts:direction="ltr">that's going to step you through some of
<br />those steps.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:06.730" end="00:02:10.970" tts:direction="ltr">Again, adding additional context of what's
<br />going on and</p>
        <p begin="00:02:10.970" end="00:02:13.290" tts:direction="ltr">common pitfalls that I can see</p>
        <p begin="00:02:13.290" end="00:02:16.170" tts:direction="ltr">students falling into as they're working
<br />through it.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:16.170" end="00:02:19.930" tts:direction="ltr">So go ahead and work on P 5.1,</p>
        <p begin="00:02:19.930" end="00:02:25.855" tts:direction="ltr">and then open up 5.2 and then watch this
<br />video as you're working through that.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:25.855" end="00:02:28.220" tts:direction="ltr">And then you'll have two more sets of</p>
        <p begin="00:02:28.220" end="00:02:30.660" tts:direction="ltr">practice assignments and two assessments.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:30.660" end="00:02:34.100" tts:direction="ltr">As always, let me know how I can help you
<br />out.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:34.100" end="00:02:36.460" tts:direction="ltr">Always feel free to send me a message.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:36.460" end="00:02:38.980" tts:direction="ltr">If you've sent me a message and I haven't
<br />gotten</p>
        <p begin="00:02:38.980" end="00:02:41.740" tts:direction="ltr">back to you in like 48 business hours,</p>
        <p begin="00:02:41.740" end="00:02:43.660" tts:direction="ltr">meaning you send it Saturday,</p>
        <p begin="00:02:43.660" end="00:02:46.980" tts:direction="ltr">and I haven't heard a response Tuesday
<br />afternoon,</p>
        <p begin="00:02:46.980" end="00:02:48.540" tts:direction="ltr">send me a reminder.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:48.540" end="00:02:52.620" tts:direction="ltr">There is a lot of students in this course
<br />and across all my courses.</p>
        <p begin="00:02:52.620" end="00:02:55.100" tts:direction="ltr">So while I try really hard to have</p>
        <p begin="00:02:55.100" end="00:02:57.340" tts:direction="ltr">a really good response rate and</p>
        <p begin="00:02:57.340" end="00:03:00.260" tts:direction="ltr">really quick turnaround time on those
<br />responses.</p>
        <p begin="00:03:00.260" end="00:03:02.780" tts:direction="ltr">So one or two does flip through my cracks,</p>
        <p begin="00:03:02.780" end="00:03:05.430" tts:direction="ltr">so please always send me that reminder.</p>
        <p begin="00:03:05.430" end="00:03:09.280" tts:direction="ltr">And there's also the ability to continue
<br />to set up time.</p>
        <p begin="00:03:09.280" end="00:03:10.920" tts:direction="ltr">If you have specific questions,</p>
        <p begin="00:03:10.920" end="00:03:12.760" tts:direction="ltr">you take that first attempt and you're</p>
        <p begin="00:03:12.760" end="00:03:14.960" tts:direction="ltr">not sure what you missed or you think
<br />there might be</p>
        <p begin="00:03:14.960" end="00:03:18.120" tts:direction="ltr">a glitch in either these assessments or</p>
        <p begin="00:03:18.120" end="00:03:21.720" tts:direction="ltr">prior assessments or you feel like you
<br />were graded unfairly,</p>
        <p begin="00:03:21.720" end="00:03:25.400" tts:direction="ltr">set up a time to meet with me and we'll go
<br />through it together.</p>
        <p begin="00:03:25.400" end="00:03:29.240" tts:direction="ltr">And I can either make sure you're awarded
<br />those points or we</p>
        <p begin="00:03:29.240" end="00:03:33.400" tts:direction="ltr">can talk through why we didn't quite get
<br />the score we were looking for.</p>
        <p begin="00:03:33.400" end="00:03:39.480" tts:direction="ltr">And with that, good luck on this week and
<br />keep doing great things.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
